                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I absolutely love the novelty of combining weapons in this game!  Combining bounce shots with speed or bomb upgrades adds a whole new dimension to the strategy.  The AI is remarkably good at high difficulty settings.  Playing head to head with a friend is a blast!!  This game brings back memories of arcade style tank shooters but brings it to a whole new level with clever puzzles and satisfying non-linearity, and genuine strategy and skill based challenges!",
